cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Startup Portfolios API: an open dataset of accelerator-backed startups"
abstract: >-
  A daily-updated open dataset and API of startups funded by Y Combinator,
  Techstars, 500 Global, Antler, Plug and Play, Entrepreneur First,
  Alchemist, SOSV (HAX, IndieBio), a16z speedrun, SparkLabs, Founder
  Institute and İTÜ Çekirdek, with
  descriptions, industries, countries, cohort years, exits and founders.
  Served as JSON, CSV and Excel.
authors:
  - alias: yigitmeteozcan
repository-code: "https://github.com/yigitmeteozcan/startups"
url: "https://yigitmeteozcan.github.io/startups/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - startups
  - accelerators
  - venture capital
  - Y Combinator
  - Techstars
  - open data
  - dataset
  - API
